OL,3,GNEWSA'When you're diagnosed, your world
OL,4,Aturns upside down'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who had his life "turned upside
OL,7,Fdown" by kidney disease has set up a
OL,8,Fgroup to support other patients.
OL,10,FIzzy Mohammed, from Bradford, was
OL,11,Fdiagnosed with the condition in 2012
OL,12,Fwhile working as a paramedic.
OL,14,FThe following year, he received a
OL,15,Fliving donor kidney transplant from his
OL,16,Fbrother, but it failed in 2021 and he
OL,17,Fhas been receiving dialysis treatment
OL,18,Fever since.
OL,20,F"It can be a very lonely place living
OL,21,Fwith kidney disease and undergoing
OL,22,Fdialysis," the 50-year-old said.
